'''Bishop Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] gains Area Attack and increases health, range and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Bishop Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

